**Convention (Dependency graph)** · `conv:decomposition:dependencies` Each indented child is a direct dependency of its parent. The verification crate is a development-only consumer; its integrated fixtures never become a production dependency. Optional raw data may travel as nonbinding package data without making host encoding depend on the raw computation engine.

